# Per spec section 16.4. DBA team owns the whole platform by default;
# per-team request directories get an additional owner so a team's own
# PR against its own requests still needs a DBA approval (CODEOWNERS
# entries are additive — both owners must approve), but the team can
# self-review non-DBA concerns in the same PR.
*                    @org/dba-team

/modules/**          @org/dba-team
/live/**             @org/dba-team
/policies/**         @org/dba-team @org/security
/.github/workflows/  @org/dba-team @org/security

# Per-team request ownership. Add one line per team as they onboard
# (spec shows this as a pattern, not a closed list) — do not use a
# wildcard here, since that would let any team approve any other
# team's request directory.
/requests/payment-team/  @org/dba-team @org/payment-team

/restores/**         @org/dba-team
